From a3823d9a3b8cb5b64efa5c0b161ed40920697015 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 02:00:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(orchestration): run workflows only on quickjs

Remove the node runtime: node.ts, node-executor.ts and node-jssg.ts, the
jssg-napi crate and package (with its node transform pool), the napi build
scripts, the fallback async context, and the node-only tests and fixtures.
quickjs is now the only and default --runtime; jssg-batch stays.

Drop the --dashboard server for now (server.ts, api.ts, session.ts). The
page and its run model (monitor.ts) stay for the Rust CLI port. Remove the
host's `select` subcommand, which only the deleted differential test used.

Fix the parallel-dynamic fixture: a dynamic() node is not thenable, so the
branch that awaited one never ran; it now awaits sequence(c1()).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
